---
// Cierre — un único call-to-action grande, cinematográfico
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[var(--color-line)]">
  <!-- Strong amber glow from bottom -->
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[60%] bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--color-accent)]/8 via-[var(--color-accent)]/3 to-transparent"
  ></div>

  <!-- Decorative giant letter -->
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-16 top-12 select-none font-display text-[clamp(12rem,24vw,24rem)] leading-none text-[var(--color-line-faint)] opacity-50"
    style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 100; font-style: italic;"
  >
    ✦
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-28 text-center sm:px-6 sm:py-36">
    <p class="cinema-label justify-center inline-flex">Apache 2.0 · GitHub público</p>

    <h2
      class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-balance font-display text-[clamp(2.4rem,5.5vw,4.4rem)] leading-[1.02] text-[var(--color-ink-primary)]"
    >
      Construye tu pipeline visual con{" "}
      <span class="italic accent" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 100;">tu propia voz</span>.
    </h2>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-secondary)]">
      Open source, multi-tenant, cost-tracked, con LoRA training wizard incluido. 413 tests verde. Cero vendor lock-in.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a
        href="/docs/getting_started"
        class="glow-amber group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] bg-[var(--color-accent)] px-7 py-4 font-mono text-[13.5px] font-medium text-[var(--color-surface-base)] no-underline"
      >
        Empezar ahora
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/elimorals/Contenido_automatizado"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-[var(--color-line-strong)] px-7 py-4 font-mono text-[13.5px] text-[var(--color-ink-secondary)] no-underline transition-all hover:border-[var(--color-accent-deep)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink-primary)]"
      >
        Ver en GitHub
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-4" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .5C5.65.5.5 5.65.5 12c0 5.08 3.29 9.39 7.86 10.91.58.11.79-.25.79-.55v-1.92c-3.2.69-3.87-1.54-3.87-1.54-.53-1.34-1.29-1.7-1.29-1.7-1.05-.71.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.71 1.26 3.37.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.55-.29-5.24-1.28-5.24-5.69 0-1.26.45-2.28 1.19-3.09-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.04 0 0 .97-.31 3.18 1.18a11.1 11.1 0 0 1 5.79 0c2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.63 1.58.23 2.75.12 3.04.74.81 1.19 1.83 1.19 3.09 0 4.42-2.7 5.4-5.26 5.69.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.13v3.15c0 .31.21.67.79.55 4.57-1.52 7.86-5.83 7.86-10.91C23.5 5.65 18.35.5 12 .5Z"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-12 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wider text-[var(--color-ink-faded)]">
      Built in Veracruz · MX · for Latam first
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
